    "id": "v2-33783-p14-practice-slot-7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "A netball club has 64 players. 41 play in the summer competition, 37 play in the winter competition.\nIf all players play in at least one competition, how many play in both?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "14 players.",
      "worked": "All 64 players play in at least one competition. Let $x$ be the number who play in both. Using the addition rule:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}64&=41+37-x\\\\64&=78-x\\\\x&=14\\end{align*}$$\n\n14 players play in both competitions.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
